# Nested package folders too: a root-only `node_modules` lets the host's
# apps/*/node_modules overwrite the image's install on COPY apps/*.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
# Local material that must never reach an image or its build cache.
# The build context is the repository: what git ignores stays out too,
# an instance's data and backups first.
data
apps/*/data
docker/lab/certs
docker/lab/seeds
coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/blob-report
*.log
*.tsbuildinfo
